 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nRandstad Componenten BV                              MASTER SERVICES\nIndustrieweg 88, 3011 AA Rotterdam, Netherlands     AGREEMENT\nBTW-nummer: NL558690754B01\nReg No: NL-198939\n\nFROM                                                   FACTUURADRES\nRandstad Componenten BV                               Van Dijk Handel BV\nIndustrieweg 88                                       Industrieweg 88\n3011 AA Rotterdam                                     3011 AA Rotterdam\nNetherlands                                           Netherlands\nVAT: NL558690754B01\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 23-01-2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Randstad Componenten BV, with its registered office at Industrieweg 88, Rotterdam (\"Party A\"), and Van Dijk\nHandel BV, with its registered office at Industrieweg 88, Rotterdam (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A   Randstad Componenten BV / Emma Bakker\nParty B   Van Dijk Handel BV / Jan de Vries\nDate      23-01-2026",
